1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
LUMEN turns a scientific question into an investigation you can run, save and review.

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Retrieving sources and writing explanations is not enough: routes and cross-step review are still missing.

3
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:32,000
A connector organizes sources, a specialist agent designs steps, and a skill reviews claims and records.

4
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:42,000
On the same flawed fixture, the new review finds five issues missed by the structural check.

5
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:49,000
The early product places results and explanations side by side; visitors must find the differences.

6
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:56,000
The revision aligns objects and changes. On-screen counts belong to a teaching experiment.

7
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:12,000
All three capabilities are reused. Source identity and limitations stay with the investigation.

8
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:20,000
Cross-entity evolution preserves useful methods and makes the product easier to inspect.
